{"seq":1,"slug":"consistency-model","title":"一致性模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-offline-first-sync/practice/consistency-model","wordCount":2014,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"一致性模型\">一致性模型</h1><p>「我这边保存了，为什么他那边还没看到？」——离线优先应用最常被用户问的问题，答案藏在一致性模型里。前面几篇反复出现「最终一致」「因果」「收敛」这些词，这一篇把它们形式化：不同强度的一致性各自承诺什么、放弃什么，时钟如何度量事件顺序，以及 CAP 定理如何在断网场景把你逼到墙角做选择。想清楚你的产品<strong>能容忍多强的不一致</strong>，是选 <a href=\"offline-frameworks\">框架</a> 和定 <a href=\"../sync/conflict-resolution\">冲突策略</a> 的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>一致性模型是一份「契约」，规定了在有多个副本、并发读写的系统里，一次读操作可能看到什么。强度从强到弱是一个连续谱：越强，编程越简单（系统表现得像单机），但越难在分布式/离线下实现、代价越高；越弱，越能容忍分区和延迟，但把更多复杂度推给应用层。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    STRONG[强一致&lt;br/&gt;线性一致] --&gt; SEQ[顺序一致]&#10;    SEQ --&gt; CAUSAL[因果一致]&#10;    CAUSAL --&gt; EVENTUAL[最终一致]&#10;    STRONG -.需要.-&gt; COORD[全局协调&lt;br/&gt;断网即不可用]&#10;    EVENTUAL -.只需.-&gt; CONV[副本最终收敛&lt;br/&gt;断网照常可写]&#10;    CAUSAL -.折中.-&gt; HAPPENS[保因果序&lt;br/&gt;不保并发序]&#10;    EVENTUAL --&gt; LF[离线优先默认区间]&#10;    CAUSAL --&gt; LF\">flowchart TD\n    STRONG[强一致&lt;br/&gt;线性一致] --&gt; SEQ[顺序一致]\n    SEQ --&gt; CAUSAL[因果一致]\n    CAUSAL --&gt; EVENTUAL[最终一致]\n    STRONG -.需要.-&gt; COORD[全局协调&lt;br/&gt;断网即不可用]\n    EVENTUAL -.只需.-&gt; CONV[副本最终收敛&lt;br/&gt;断网照常可写]\n    CAUSAL -.折中.-&gt; HAPPENS[保因果序&lt;br/&gt;不保并发序]\n    EVENTUAL --&gt; LF[离线优先默认区间]\n    CAUSAL --&gt; LF</pre><p>离线优先几乎必然落在这张谱的右半边——因果一致或最终一致。原因很直接：强一致要求每次写入都经全局协调达成共识，而断网时根本无法协调。选择离线优先，就是选择放弃强一致、换取分区容忍与可用性。这个取舍不是缺陷，是<strong>刻意的设计</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从强一致到最终一致-谱系详解\">从强一致到最终一致：谱系详解</h2><p>逐级理解这几档，才能在需求评审时说清「我们能接受哪一档」。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>一致性</th>\n<th>承诺</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n<th align=\"center\">离线优先适配</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>线性一致（强）</td>\n<td>每次读都看到最新写，全系统像单副本</td>\n<td>需全局协调，分区时不可用</td>\n<td align=\"center\">不适配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>顺序一致</td>\n<td>所有副本看到相同的操作顺序（未必实时）</td>\n<td>仍需全局定序</td>\n<td align=\"center\">勉强</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>因果一致</td>\n<td>有因果关系的操作按序可见，并发操作各副本可不同序</td>\n<td>需追踪因果（版本向量）</td>\n<td align=\"center\">良好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最终一致</td>\n<td>停止写入后，副本最终收敛到同一状态</td>\n<td>中间态可读到旧值/乱序</td>\n<td align=\"center\">天然契合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>强最终一致（CRDT）</td>\n<td>见过相同操作集的副本状态必然相同</td>\n<td>需 CRDT 数据结构</td>\n<td align=\"center\">理想</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>其中<strong>因果一致</strong>是离线优先的甜点区。纯最终一致允许违反因果——你可能先看到「回复」后看到「原帖」，这很怪。因果一致修补了这点：它保证「若操作 B 依赖操作 A（B 发生时已见 A），则任何副本都不会在见到 B 之前没见到 A」，用形式化记号写作 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A \\rightarrow B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>（A happens-before B）。而 <strong>强最终一致</strong>是 CRDT 提供的额外承诺——不只是「最终收敛」，而是「见过相同操作集就一定相同」，这比普通最终一致更强，正是 <a href=\"../sync/crdt-merge\">CRDT</a> 的价值所在。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用时钟度量-谁先谁后\">用时钟度量「谁先谁后」</h2><p>要实现因果一致，得能判断两个事件的先后。物理时钟不可靠（各机器不同步），于是有了逻辑时钟。</p>\n<p><strong>Lamport 时钟</strong>给每个事件一个整数标量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>：本地事件递增 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>；发消息带上 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>；收消息时置 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>local</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>msg</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = \\max(L_{\\text{local}}, L_{\\text{msg}}) + 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">local</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">msg</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>。它保证「若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A \\rightarrow B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L(A) &lt; L(B)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>」，但反过来不成立——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L(A) &lt; L(B)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 未必意味着有因果关系，可能只是并发。所以 Lamport 时钟能定一个全序，却<strong>丢失了并发信息</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>向量时钟</strong>（即上一章的版本向量）修补了这点：每个副本维护一个向量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_i[j]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 记「副本 i 已知副本 j 的第几个事件」。比较两个向量时：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>B</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>每个分量</mtext><mo>≤</mo><mtext>且至少一个</mtext><mo>&lt;</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A \\rightarrow B \\iff V(A) &lt; V(B) \\quad(\\text{每个分量} \\leq \\text{且至少一个} &lt;)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7073em;vertical-align:-0.024em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">每个分量</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">且至少一个</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>若两向量互不支配，则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 并发。这正是 <a href=\"../sync/conflict-resolution\">冲突解决</a> 里精确检测冲突的数学基础。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时钟</th>\n<th align=\"center\">能定全序</th>\n<th align=\"center\">能测并发</th>\n<th>大小</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>物理时钟</td>\n<td align=\"center\">是（但不可靠）</td>\n<td align=\"center\">否</td>\n<td>常数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Lamport 标量时钟</td>\n<td align=\"center\">是</td>\n<td align=\"center\">否</td>\n<td>常数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>向量时钟</td>\n<td align=\"center\">是</td>\n<td align=\"center\">是</td>\n<td>O(副本数)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合逻辑时钟 HLC</td>\n<td align=\"center\">是</td>\n<td align=\"center\">否（近似物理时间）</td>\n<td>常数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>**混合逻辑时钟（HLC）**是工程上的实用折中：把物理时间和一个逻辑计数器打包，既接近真实墙钟时间（方便人读、方便和外部系统对齐），又保证单调、能给出因果一致的定序。很多现代同步引擎（如带 LWW 语义的系统）用 HLC 取代裸 <code>Date.now()</code>，正是为了缓解上一章说的「LWW 靠不可靠时钟」问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"cap-定理-离线场景的墙角\">CAP 定理:离线场景的墙角</h2><p>CAP 定理说：在网络分区（Partition）发生时，一个分布式系统只能在一致性（Consistency）和可用性（Availability）之间二选一。离线优先的处境把这个抽象定理变得无比具体——<strong>用户断网，就是一次持续的网络分区</strong>。</p>\n<p>于是选择摆在眼前：分区期间，要么拒绝写入以保强一致（选 C，牺牲 A——但这就不是离线优先了），要么允许本地继续读写、事后收敛（选 A，牺牲强 C）。离线优先永远选后者。更精细的框架是 <strong>PACELC</strong>：分区时在 A/C 间选（离线优先选 A），无分区时在延迟（L）和一致性（C）间选（离线优先选低延迟 L）。两个选择合起来，正好定义了离线优先的性格——<strong>永远优先可用性与低延迟，用最终收敛偿还一致性的欠账</strong>。</p>\n<p>这也解释了 <a href=\"../sync/crdt-merge\">CRDT 与合并</a> 里那条冷水：CRDT 能保证收敛（一种最终一致），但<strong>无法提供跨记录的全局不变量</strong>（如余额非负），因为全局不变量本质上需要强一致、需要分区时的全局协调——而这恰恰是离线优先放弃的东西。想要全局约束，就得为那部分数据退回服务端权威，即 <a href=\"../foundations/offline-vs-online-first\">离线与在线优先之别</a> 讲的混合架构。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为你的数据选一档\">为你的数据选一档</h2><p>把这一篇收束成可操作的判断。对每类数据问三个问题：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>能容忍读到旧值吗？</strong> 不能 → 需强一致 → 这类数据别做离线优先。能 → 继续。</li>\n<li><strong>需要保证因果顺序吗？</strong>（回复必须在原帖后可见、状态转移必须有序）需要 → 因果一致 + 向量时钟/HLC。不太在意 → 最终一致够用。</li>\n<li><strong>有跨记录的硬约束吗？</strong>（余额、库存、唯一性）有 → 那部分退回服务端强一致；无 → 放心用 CRDT 的强最终一致。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>绝大多数离线优先应用的答案是「大部分数据走因果/最终一致，少数关键数据走服务端强一致」——又一次回到混合架构。选定了一致性档位，下一步才是挑一个能兑现这个档位的框架。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>一致性模型是关于「读能看到什么」的契约，强度从线性一致到最终一致是连续谱：越强越好编程但越难在离线下实现。</li>\n<li>离线优先必然落在右半边（因果/最终一致），因为断网无法做强一致所需的全局协调——这是刻意取舍。</li>\n<li>因果一致是甜点区：保证有因果关系的操作按序可见（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A \\rightarrow B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>），并发操作各副本可不同序；CRDT 提供更强的「强最终一致」。</li>\n<li>逻辑时钟度量先后：Lamport 时钟能定全序但丢并发信息，向量时钟能测并发（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>B</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A\\rightarrow B \\iff V(A)&lt;V(B)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7073em;vertical-align:-0.024em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>），HLC 是接近墙钟又单调的工程折中。</li>\n<li>CAP 在离线场景具体化为「用户断网=持续分区」，离线优先永远选可用性 + 低延迟，用最终收敛偿还一致性；全局不变量需退回服务端强一致，导向混合架构。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>上游机制：并发检测见 <a href=\"../sync/conflict-resolution\">冲突解决</a>，收敛保证见 <a href=\"../sync/crdt-merge\">CRDT 与合并</a></li>\n<li>落地：据一致性档位选型见 <a href=\"offline-frameworks\">框架 (RxDB/ElectricSQL)</a>，混合架构见 <a href=\"../foundations/offline-vs-online-first\">离线与在线优先之别</a></li>\n<li>跨库：因果一致与时钟的深入讨论见 <a href=\"../../local-first-sync-engines/data-consistency/causal-consistency-clocks\">51_local-first-sync-engines / 因果一致与时钟</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"一致性模型","id":"一致性模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"从强一致到最终一致：谱系详解","id":"从强一致到最终一致-谱系详解"},{"level":2,"text":"用时钟度量「谁先谁后」","id":"用时钟度量-谁先谁后"},{"level":2,"text":"CAP 定理:离线场景的墙角","id":"cap-定理-离线场景的墙角"},{"level":2,"text":"为你的数据选一档","id":"为你的数据选一档"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"CRDT 与合并","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-offline-first-sync/sync/crdt-merge"},"next":{"title":"框架 (RxDB/ElectricSQL)","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-offline-first-sync/practice/offline-frameworks"}}